# Feature flags

- Evaluate flags through OpenFeature clients only. Do not call the GrowthBook SDK directly from feature or UI code.
- GrowthBook is the OpenFeature provider (server for Nest, client for Angular).
- Use flags for rollout, kill switches, and experiments.
- Use Neon `workspace_tools` (or equivalent entitlements) for which product tools a workspace has enabled.
- Name flags with dotted domains: `tools.vibestandup.enabled`, `addons.github.webhooks`.
- Default safely: missing flag => off for new tools; keep core shell available.
